    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Combots is a multiplayer robot war shooter set in fully procedurally generated maps with the physical environment.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 unique robots allow you to experience the game in a new way when playing for each of them.<br></li><li>22 items for loadout, allow you to create many variations of robots.<br></li><li>4 procedurally generated maps. Each game you will be greeted by a new map for battle.<br></li><li>6 game modes that will dilute the fun.<br></li><li>43 cosmetic items where everyone can decorate their robot in their own way.</li></ul>",
